#. type: Title #
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "002 — Issue workflow"
msgstr "002 — Fluxo de issues"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "The process of handing incoming issues is the following:"
msgstr "O processo de tratamento das issues recebidas é o seguinte:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "![Issue workflow schema](/images/internals/002-issue-workflow.svg)"
msgstr "![Esquema do fluxo de issues](/images/internals/002-issue-workflow.svg)"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Papéis"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "We've many roles:"
msgstr "Temos vários papéis:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Process managers - initially triage issues and manage labels."
msgstr "Gerentes de processo - fazem a triagem inicial das issues e gerenciam os labels."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Decision makers - participate in discussions moving them to resolutions."
msgstr "Tomadores de decisão - participam das discussões, levando-as a uma resolução."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Bug hunters - verifying bugs."
msgstr "Caçadores de bugs - verificam os bugs."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Contributors - create code for pull requests."
msgstr "Contribuidores - escrevem o código dos pull requests."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Code reviewers - review pull requests."
msgstr "Revisores de código - revisam os pull requests."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "A single person may take one or more roles in the issue-resolving process."
msgstr "Uma mesma pessoa pode assumir um ou mais papéis no processo de resolução de issues."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Labels"
msgstr "Labels"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "We label issues to mark many things: current status, issue type, component affected. Status labels speak for themselves."
msgstr "Usamos labels nas issues para marcar várias coisas: status atual, tipo da issue, componente afetado. Os labels de status falam por si."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Milestones"
msgstr "Milestones"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/internals/002-issue-workflow.md
msgid "Issues aren't assigned to milestones unless they're critical or there is a likely good pull request exists."
msgstr "As issues não são atribuídas a milestones, a menos que sejam críticas ou que provavelmente exista um bom pull request para elas."
